  "Scenes.Nephilacovenfollowerscene.AscendThroneSecondAscension2.UltimatelyLittleBeast": "Ultimately, of course, the little beast's escape attempt is fruitless, and it is quickly subdued and shoved into your vagina. You barely even notice, having forgotten about it the moment it ceased to amuse you. It's rather small, after all, even if you have already been filled at both ends and feel fit to burst. Besides, there's something more pressing for you to consider.[pg]"
